OL,3,GNEWSAMan taken to hospital after car
OL,4,Aand motorbike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was taken to hospital following a
OL,7,Fcrash involving a car and a motorbike
OL,8,Fin Derbyshire.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FAshopton Road, in Bamford, at about
OL,12,F09:40 BST on Saturday.
OL,14,FDerbyshire Police said the rider's
OL,15,Finjuries were not thought to be
OL,16,Flife-threatening or life-changing and
OL,17,Fthat no-one else was hurt.
OL,19,FThe road was closed from the junction
OL,20,Fwith Tags Knoll to the A57, and has
OL,21,Fsince reopened.
